# React Native + Expo Conventions

## Component Structure
- Use functional components with TypeScript interfaces for props
- Export components as named exports from `src/components/ui/`
- Screen components are default exports in the `app/` directory (Expo Router)

## Expo Router
- Screens live in `app/` as files — the filename becomes the route
- Layouts use `_layout.tsx` files
- Tab routes go in `app/(tabs)/`
- Use `expo-router` Link and router for navigation, not React Navigation APIs

## Theming
- Always use `ThemedText` and `ThemedView` instead of raw `Text` and `View`
- Get theme colors via `useThemeColor()` hook — returns the full color palette
- Never hardcode color hex values in components

## Imports
- Use relative imports from `src/` in app/ files (e.g., `../../src/components/ui/ThemedText`)
- Use relative imports within `src/` (e.g., `../constants/Colors`)

## Performance
- `react-native-reanimated/plugin` must be the LAST plugin in babel.config.js
- Use `ScrollView` with `showsVerticalScrollIndicator={false}` for scrollable content
- Prefer `StyleSheet.create()` for static styles
